# Project structure

- shadcn UI → `src/components/ui/` (primitives only)
- Domain presentational UI → `src/components/[domain]/`
- Shared UI (≥2 domains) → `src/components/shared/`
- Feature modules → `src/features/[domain]/` (same `*.types.ts` / `*.constants.ts` layout as components; compose UI and wire hooks, fetchers, and Next.js server actions)
- HTTP + Zod → `src/fetchers/[domain]/`
- Tanstack Query hooks → `src/hooks/[domain]/` (usable from components and features)
- Context + app-wide providers → `src/providers/` (compose in `AppProviders`)
- shadcn `cn` → `src/lib/utils.ts`
- Locale config → `src/i18n/`; catalogs → `src/messages/`
- Global utils/types/constants → `src/utils`, `src/types`, `src/constants` (`utils` usable from components and features)
- E2E → `e2e/[domain]/[path].spec.ts`
- Next.js routes → `src/app/`; Vite screens → `src/pages/`

Do not call Tanstack Query or `fetch` directly from components. Go through `hooks` / `fetchers`, usually via a feature.

Details: `docs/frontend/conventions/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`
